   hidden there (no reliance on pixel-perfect alignment); only the click glow
   shows. They fade in together with slide 2's crossfade. Going back, they
   hold until slide 1's zoom has settled (--dur-zoom; 0 under reduced motion)
   and then fade out over the baked lamps, which by then are in place. The
   buttons stay in place and clickable on both slides. */
